xmodel/block-descent-a1-rank4-reducible-component-tree-ledger-hostile-review-sol56-20260831.md:259:The missing dicritical typing affects Lemma 2.2, every finite-tree claim, every leftover, and the maximum-safe statement. The signed-Euler error removes R10--R14, adds at least six mixed generic-inertia classes, changes the survivor ranking, and invalidates the `16/4/12` counts and both replay digests for any corrected script. The R2/R3 premise changes the advertised independent-kill count. Pair-transport omissions invalidate only the finer `rho_i` screen, not the local ban on `S22` at `T31`. Stale promotion labels and the all-degree citation have zero row-level blast radius. The promoted rank-four theorem and the conditional implication of Lemma 2.3 survive.
