xmodel/grok-nfd-review.md:6:Claims under review: (1) replay M1 monotonicity and permanence of `Omega` (hunt a letter that rescales rather than extends); (2) td-7 `D=4` via `Pi=11305=5·7·17·19` and the complete 15-multiset menu; (3) td-11: all three entries have `D=0` because the valuation windows are empty (11-A `v_2` promoted, 11-B `v_3` 0 vs 1, 11-C `v_2` 1 vs 2); (4) all six CE orders DEAD — verify at least CE3 (`den(α_*)=13566` forced, first `k` 39270 vs 87297210); (5) OB2 fail-closed direction: for a census, fail-closed must KEEP-AS-POSSIBLY-LIVE, not discard.
