+```text
+through next two orders s^-1,s^0:  c plus b1_9,b2_8  -> dimension 3 localized
+through s^4:                       c plus b1_9,b2_8,b4_8,b6_8
+                                  -> dimension 5 localized
+after the slice c=1:               dimension 4 through s^4
